    <string name="spotify_section_title">Spotify</string>
    <string name="spotify_section_footer">Connect Spotify to bring your playlists into LFly; your Liked Songs become your Favourites. Songs are played by LFly, not by Spotify. You sign in on Spotify\'s own page: your password never passes through LFly.</string>
